  "limitations": [
    "UNBUILT source queue only: nine unchanged original files, 163,828 bytes and one original commit. One 1008x630 JPEG fan-upload cover plus eight text/JSON files; zero native video frames, models or new model stages. The covered stone steps, rocks, vegetation and water provide one heavily obscured partial view, insufficient for a complete scene or reconstruction eligibility.",
    "Frozen official identity records bridge the 2023-04-03 upload BV1am4y1z71Y to 2023-03-31 livestream BV1is4y1U7dY and the official reservation. This is not evidence of later performance reuse. The fan cover BV1224y1L73E by 残天大魔王 is not upgraded to an official native frame, exact time, real location or verified scene identity. The archive worker verifies frozen bytes and record consistency, without new external browsing or authentication.",
    "The included independent QA reports bounded comparison with two existing garden/lantern images. Their hashes and dimensions are metadata in qa/evidence.json; those two comparison images are not part of this nine-file payload. This archive does not claim to reproduce the comparison, establish exhaustive repository deduplication, or prove a new complete scene. Backside, scale and water boundaries remain unknown; the performer umbrella is not classified as fixed scene geometry.",
    "Seven recorded additional queries and seven identity records are retained. The replay record contains only a bilibili shell; no video is decoded. Other collage covers and the spring-market promotional/unrelated pictures are excluded from the image payload. Spring-market exclusion text records a stopped HTTP403 request; this archive performs no such external requests, bypasses or retries.",
    "Original review.zh.md cites identity-and-coverage.json, which is absent under that name. Actual archived records are identity.json and coverage.json. This stale filename is preserved and disclosed without rewriting the original. Historical page text excerpts and excluded image filenames remain as source observations, not additional delivered images.",
    "Only new independent research archive/history refs are created. All existing production/research refs, model CURRENT, paths and failure history remain unchanged. No modeling, rendering, producer script execution, credentials copying, LFS, force push, history deletion, main/security changes, Issues or PRs. The previously denied source-screening-increment receipt stays paused. Space version0 remains retained pending parent confirmation."
  ],
